{"id":"vod_sn_36620","vodId":"36620","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"翼·年代记第一季","name_cn":"翼·年代记第一季","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ef4e3cdd33d7ff1703294e5fed5553a3.jpg"},"summary":"同样的名字，不一样的身份。在《翼》的国度里，小狼（入野自由 配音）成为了玖楼国的考古学家，而小樱（牧野由依 配音）则是该国的公主。二人情投意合却迟迟没有把心意传给对方。在小樱下定决心想要向小狼表白的那晚，玖楼国的遗迹催动了小樱体内能力的苏醒，致使小樱的记忆变成羽毛飞往了各个方向且昏迷不醒。为了找回小樱的记忆，小狼和另外两位怀着不同目的的伙伴黑钢（稻田彻 配音）、法伊（浪川大辅 配音）跨越不同的次元，寻找着记忆的羽毛，踏上了冒险的征程。而这背后则酝酿着一个巨大的阴谋……　　本片改编自CLAMP的同名漫画。剧中大量出现CLAMP过往作品里的角色，且角色关系都有很大调整，可谓CLAMP自己亲自操刀的同人作。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c0LaBTrQGM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tu1pnxSsnU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kynxYi9KAU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jMkSamabzL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/KNk4xRzW3V1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hxeuALkesK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fcT8yhvvmL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FNpC6xPU1t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wG7tsv8wBF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RrwbVVL0SE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Z0RL2Z08py1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/am2ZxXYRmJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2aW7s0uP711/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TPWM9FLDMR1/video/ind